comment2.text=\r\n\ Reads\ item\ data\ from\ a\ comma-separated\ line\ using\ a\ Scanner\r\n\ Expects\ the\ fields\ to\ be\ in\ this\ order\:\ name,\ code,\ cost\r\n\ @param\ lineScanner\ -\ a\ scanner\ set\ up\ to\ read\ one\ line\ of\ comma-separated\ data\r\n\r\n
